            "review_title": "Review at Bandido Mercado - Tacos & Tequila",
            "review_text": "Mike B\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nGreat Taco's in HCMC\nJul 2024 • Business\nBandido small restaurant in nice food court . It attract me by their colorfull stand. The menu looks great. Variety of food is very good. Great frozen Margarita, which goes very well with the Taco's. Must try when you don't want to eat local food.\nWritten July 15, 2024",
