            "review_title": "Review at Bandido Mercado - Tacos & Tequila",
            "review_text": "Sam\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nThe perfect street food experience\nNov 2023 • Friends\nThe food court is a great place to go with friends, especially when you can't decide what to eat. But my absolute favorite booth is Bandido! The tacos and burritos are delicious and the frozen marg is to die for (the mango is my favorite). \n\nIf you want to have an even better dining experience, I recommend going to Bandido's restaurant, also located in District 1.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nYou can't miss Bandido when visiting the food court. It is right at the entrance. On Tuesday & Saturday there's live music too!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 1, 2024",
